    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KW Wexford is proud to present this 3000 sq ft Detached Passive Dormer Bungalow . This comfortable four / six bedroom home is situated on its own private mature site and is within a ten minute walk from the famous Strand. The property has four bedrooms (4 double)and 3 extra reception rooms/ bedrooms. What a property….zero bills along with a new detached 1400 sq ft Garage.\r\nThe whole property is in mint condition and decorated to the hilt !\r\n\r\nIt also features a very large west facing conservatory.\r\nViewing is a must.\r\nTons of extras!\r\n\r\nThe property will make for a very large holiday home or permanent residence.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises livingroom, kitchen/ dining area, utility room, two double bedrooms and bathroom downstairs and four bedrooms upstairs (double room with bathroom). Over recent years Rosslare Strand has become increasingly popular with families young and old looking for a permanent home.\r\n\r\nFunding has been granted to bring Rosslare strand to the next level with bicycle tracks and a host of new amenities.\r\nFacilities nearby include two small supermarkets, two golf courses, two pubs, bus and rail links to Wexford Town and beyond, National School, recreational hub and two hotels including the famous award winning Kelly's Resort Hotel. This home offers you the benefit of being within walking distance of all the amenities on offer whilst also being on its own private site that is a short distance away from the hussle and bustle of the main\"drag\" of Strand Road.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment only."
      },
      {
